  "thumbnail_url": null,
  "body": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sometimes space is at a premium, we understand just how valuable screen real estate can be. If you need to make the most of your monitor you may want to try out </span><strong>Compact Text Mode. </strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here's how to find it:</span></p>\n<p><strong>User Settings -&gt; Appearance -&gt; Message Display -&gt; Compact Mode</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Just check the box for Compact mode and you are all set!</span></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/115002557131\" alt=\"Compact_Mode1.PNG\" width=\"616\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The biggest difference you'll see is that user avatars no longer show up. What was once:</span></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/205288777\" alt=\"\" width=\"625\" height=\"525\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Now gets shrunk down to:</span></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/205288807\" alt=\"\" width=\"625\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No more avatars and many more messages!  Don't forget that role colors will still be prevalent as well.</span></p>",
  "body_hash": "f99d9f88c8a48a16dc095fa56f5376f8d610e160575bca1ac576fbb9f5b23099",
